{{!--
Shared "home page" header/featured/CTA block, included at the top of both
home.hbs and index.hbs/index-he.hbs so every page of a collection (not just
page 1) gets the same rich layout - only the post-list feed differs per file.

Parameters:
* postFilter (Ghost filter string scoping this collection, e.g. "tag:-[hash-he]")
* featuredLabel (heading label for the featured section)
--}}

{{> "components/header" headerStyle=@custom.header_style postFilter=postFilter featuredLabel=featuredLabel}}

{{#match @custom.header_style "!=" "Highlight"}}
{{> "components/featured" showFeatured=@custom.show_featured_posts limit=4 postFilter=postFilter titleLabel=featuredLabel}}
{{/match}}

{{> "components/cta"}}
